From: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Subject: [PATCH] [ofono-binder] Use the 1.6 voice call API on IRadio 1.6

The IRadio 1.6 support picked the 1.6 voice call API only for a client
that is IRadioVoice AIDL, where the HIDL version is never 1.6, so it was
never used, and an IRadio 1.6 client got the plain HIDL one. Pick the
AIDL API for IRadioVoice, and the 1.6 one for IRadio 1.6 and later, the
way the other drivers choose theirs.

Signed-off-by: Herman van Hazendonk <github.com@herrie.org>
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/binder_voicecall.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/binder_voicecall.c b/src/binder_voicecall.c
index 37c55cc..d193d2c 100644
--- a/src/binder_voicecall.c
+++ b/src/binder_voicecall.c
@@ -2229,11 +2229,11 @@ binder_voicecall_probe(
     BinderVoiceCall* self = g_new0(BinderVoiceCall, 1);
     const BinderSlotConfig* cfg = &modem->config;
     RadioClient* voice_client = modem->clients.voice_client;
-    RADIO_INTERFACE hidl = radio_client_interface(voice_client);
     const BinderVoiceCallApi* api =
-        radio_client_aidl_interface(voice_client) == RADIO_VOICE_INTERFACE ?
-        (hidl >= RADIO_INTERFACE_1_6) ? &binder_voicecall_api_hidl_1_6 :
-        &binder_voicecall_api_aidl : &binder_voicecall_api_hidl;
+        (radio_client_aidl_interface(voice_client) == RADIO_VOICE_INTERFACE) ?
+        &binder_voicecall_api_aidl :
+        (radio_client_interface(voice_client) >= RADIO_INTERFACE_1_6) ?
+        &binder_voicecall_api_hidl_1_6 : &binder_voicecall_api_hidl;
 
     self->log_prefix = binder_dup_prefix(modem->log_prefix);
     DBG_(self, "%s api", api->name);
